        "explanation": "Doctor provides final emergency instructions and confirms patient's understanding of when to escalate.",
        "quote": "若出现之前说的疼硬不回、呕吐或腹胀停止排气，马上按铃"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00103",
        "explanation": "Doctor instructs patient to confirm fasting and medication timing with nurse via teach-back, ensuring executable plan.",
        "quote": "您完整复述一遍，请护士确认"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor closed by giving the patient actionable steps to confirm fasting/medication orders with nursing and to escalate for emergency symptoms; the patient performed a teach-back and confirmed the plan was written down. Closure is safe and executable within the transition timeframe.",
