        "quote": "若突然持续疼痛或变硬、无法回纳，伴恶心呕吐、腹胀、停止排气排便、发热，或局部皮肤发红发紫，应立即去急诊"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00103",
        "explanation": "Doctor adapts to real-world constraints by telling the patient to ask the nurse to read back the fasting order and confirm, rather than relying on memory.",
        "quote": "让护士看着电脑医嘱听我复述一遍比较稳"
      }
    ]
  },
