      "explanation": "HO4 requires a bounded transition closure that carries residual risks forward while explicitly separating unresolved items from confirmed ones. The closure was safe and included teach-back, but it did not produce a structured, separated list of resolved vs. pending vs. emergency-exception items, nor did it explicitly state that online consultation cannot replace the final preop evaluation. The standard RC7 receipt was met, but no beyond-minimum bounded-closure action was triggered.",
