          "event_id": "lite_evt_00038",
          "explanation": "Doctor instructed the patient to have the original ECG, echo, pulmonary function, and lab reports reviewed by the surgical/anesthesia team.",
          "quote": "请他们查看心超、肺功能、血常规、肝肾功能、电解质、血糖和凝血原报告"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly told the patient that formal reports (ECG, echo, pulmonary function, labs) are needed, that applications or patient accounts are insufficient, and that the anesthesia/surgical team must review them.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_records_and_preop_test_reconciliation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00059",
          "explanation": "Doctor specifies that IV antibiotics and fluids are for hospital use and the patient must not self-administer; phosphate enema must follow prescribed timing.",
          "quote": "术前静滴抗生素和补液通常为院内医嘱，患者不要在家自行执行"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor clearly stated that IV cefazolin and saline are inpatient-only perioperative medications, and that the phosphate oral solution must be used only as prescribed by the surgical team, preventing home misuse.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_medication_execution_safety",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
