          "explanation": "Doctor gave specific waiting-period self-care: avoid heavy lifting, straining, and coughing; use hand to support hernia area; maintain bowel regularity.",
          "quote": "避免提重物、用力排便和剧烈咳嗽；保持大便通畅，咳嗽时可用手轻托疝块周围"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provided concrete risk-reduction measures including avoiding increased intra-abdominal pressure, keeping bowels regular, and not self-medicating with bowel prep.",
